    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d118">

                <pb facs="0278" n="190" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv02/pg190"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">863.00/112: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Special
                        Representative</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">House</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-18T21:00:00-05:00"
                            >November 18, 1918—9 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>46. The Swiss Minister, by direction of his Government, has delivered to the
                    Department the following strictly confidential communication:<anchor n="8a"
                        xml:id="d118-f1"/>
                    <pb facs="0279" n="191" xml:id="pg191"/>
                    <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“In view of the revolution which threatens to break out at Vienna under
                            the leadership of the extreme socialist party, the diplomatic
                            representatives of the neutral countries at Vienna, under the presidency
                            of the Papal Nuncio, decided to recommend to their Governments the
                            immediate intervention with the powers of the Entente with a view to
                            request the occupation, as a strategical point, of the city of Vienna by
                            Entente forces, in accordance with paragraph 4 of the terms of the
                            armistice. This measure alone could guarantee order.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Advise Dept. of action contemplated.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d118-f1" n="8a" xml:id="d118-f1-content">
                <p>This communication was forwarded by the Swiss Government as intermediary
                    only.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
